{
  "slug": "knowmine-personal-knowledge-base",
  "name": "Knowmine Personal Knowledge Base",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Save notes and decisions during AI conversations. Search them later by meaning, not keywords. Works across Claude Code and any MCP-compatible AI.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `conversation-distill` (Use when a user asks to distill/save a conversation to KnowMine, says 沉淀/收尾/归档本次对话, or a meaningful conversation naturally…), `knowmine` (Save notes, decisions, and insights with semantic search via MCP)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `knowmine`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install knowmine-personal-knowledge-base@claude-community` from `YIING99/knowmine-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
